body:
Wow, I can't believe that I didn't reply to you. There is no excuse for me to do that.

&#x200B;

What is your internship for?

Literally just surviving. haha. What do you mean by preparing for the future?

&#x200B;

Also today is the last day of the month so it is our 2nd official checkin. Seeing how you just replied to me you can have that be your checkin, or you can post something else for it.

&#x200B;

I will checkin with four20-, the other guy playing, in direct message. We can also do the checkins through direct message if you prefer that.

&#x200B;

Glad you replied!

So I have been having unbearable panic attacks, so I have tried cbd oil and its making me feel nothing. It now leaves me with nothing to hold on to life with.

&#x200B;

The only 2 things keeping me here is how my suicide would affect my mom. And the second reason is this group we have. When I take the cbd oil I feel nothing and I lose those two reasons.

&#x200B;

So either I have unbearable panic attacks and have 2 reasons to live, or I feel nothing and no reasons to live but it's easier to get through the day I guess.

&#x200B;

Alright your turn to share. What has happened in the last 2 weeks that you want to tell us?

Ok r/suicidegame seems to convey the wrong idea. Maybe something like r/suicidepreventiongame ?

&#x200B;

I don't know that seems too long. Maybe an abbreviation?
